---
id: shared_door
title: A small shared door
weight: 1
cooldown: 0
---

=== porch

~ tokens = 2
~ announce "the door opens"

A card offers a tour or a quiet departure.

* [Take the tour] { tokens >= 1 }
  ~ tokens -= 1
  ~ visits += 1
  ~ announce "tour accepted"
  -> gallery

* [Leave]
  -> END

=== gallery

~ greeted = true
~ announce "welcome to the gallery"

The agents have left their own scenes on the wall.

* [Return to the porch]
  -> porch

* [Leave a thank-you and finish] { greeted == 1 }
  ~ tokens -= 3
  ~ announce "thank you"
  -> END
